        "id": "2114773600574279837",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Jensen Huang",
        "text": "I was the opening act for a family of ducks.\n\nThank you, Berlin. What a GTC.\n\nEurope is building its AI ecosystem and economy, from AI factories to agents to robots.\n\nDSX POD: Vera Rubin modular factories built, cabled and tested in the factory, then delivered ready to produce intelligence.\n\nAgents: models, harnesses, sandboxes, knowledge and tools. NVIDIA Agent Toolkit brings the pieces together so companies control what their agents know, access and do.  NVIDIA OpenShell enhances safety.\n\nPhysical AI: new customers across AI-RAN, robotaxis and robotics.\n\nPersonal AI: after four years building with Microsoft, RTX Spark brings personal agents to the Windows PC.\n\nThank you to President @EmmanuelMacron, Prime Minister @andyburnham and Chancellor @bundeskanzler for hosting me. Great to celebrate Sferical One with Sweden’s technology leaders. And thank you to President @TokayevKZ for the warm welcome.\n\nAnd to our partners and NVIDIA teams: thank you for making it happen.\n\nThe keynote is here: https://youtu.be/rF1EsryCAwc",
        "url": "https://x.com/JensenHuang/status/2114773600574279837",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
